@startuml bond_payment
title Bond Payment Phase

actor "Participant\n(S or V)" as P
participant "DST Token\nContract" as DST
participant "Smart Contract\n(SC)" as SC

== Enrollment phase (see Section 2.2.2 / 2.2.3) ==

...

== Bond Payment ==

P -> DST : Authorize bond transfer to SC
P -> SC : Deposit bond
SC -> DST : Transfer bond tokens from P
DST --> SC : Tokens transferred
SC -> SC : Update participant bond balance

note over P, SC
  The same flow applies to senders and verifiers,
  with different bond amounts:
  ・ Sender: maxDataPerSender × dataSenderBondPerData
  ・ Verifier: maxDataPerVerifierPerBond × dataVerifierBondPerData
end note

== Data submission (Section 2.2.4) / Verification (Section 2.2.5) ==

...

@enduml
